  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Set on this prime beachfront position, located within one of Takapuna’s most tightly held seaward streets, ‘The Beach House’ is a rare expression of coastal living. Offering an exceptional 260sqm residence with an effortless lock-up-and-leave appeal with it's direct connection to one of Auckland’s most celebrated beaches.\r\n\r\nWith uninterrupted views across the Hauraki Gulf and private access to Takapuna Beach, the setting is quite simply breathtaking. Here, the rhythm of coastal living is woven into everyday life, morning swims, long summer lunches, evenings spent watching the changing light across the water.\r\n\r\nGenerously proportioned and practically configured, the home offers four bedrooms, two distinct living areas and three bathrooms. The principal living space opens to a broad ocean-facing deck, creating a seamless connection between indoors and out, while a beautifully private summer courtyard provides another inviting setting for entertaining, dining, or simply enjoying the coastal atmosphere.\r\n\r\n‘Considerable work has already been undertaken, enhancing the home’s comfort while providing a solid foundation for its next chapter’\r\n\r\nBeyond the property itself, the address is the defining feature. Takapuna’s renowned beach, village, restaurants, cafés and boutiques are all within easy reach, while exceptional schooling and the broader amenities of the North Shore further enhance the appeal.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this combination of scale with uninterrupted ocean views and blue-chip seaward positioning seldom come to market.\r\n\r\nThe Beach House is an opportunity to secure not simply a home, but a rare piece of Takapuna’s coastline, a sophisticated, low-maintenance coastal sanctuary in an address where land, view and lifestyle are quite simply irreplaceable.",
